{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43172","headline":"王龙骧墓 · 贾彦璋","name":"王龙骧墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔擅登坛宠，爰光典午朝。\n刀悬临益梦，龙啓渡江谣。\n茂绩当年举，英魂此地销。\n唯余孤壠上，日夕起松飙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾彦璋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}